IHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>CANON KABUSHIKI KAISHA</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YANAGISAWA, YOSHIHIRO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>YANAGISAWA YOSHIHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>YANAGISAWA, YOSHIHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A method of manufacturing an imaging device comprises the steps of (a) forming first electrodes and second electrodes on a rear plate; (b) forming a film consisting of a photosensitive material and a conductive material selectively on the rear plate through openings of desire shapes in a mask; (c) shedding light to desired regions of the film formed on the rear plate; (d) patterning the film; (e) baking the patterned film to form a plurality of conductors to be connected with the electrodes; and (f) forming conductive film for connecting the first and second electrodes.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Un procédé de production d'un dispositif d'imagerie comprend les étapes consistant (a) à former des premières et des secondes électrodes sur une plaque arrière, (b) à former une couche mince constituée d'un matériau photosensible et d'un matériau conducteur sélectivement sur la plaque arrière par des ouvertures ayant les formes voulues dans un masque, (c) à répandre de la lumière dans les régions voulues de la couche mince formée sur la plaque arrière, (d) à former un motif sur la couche mince, (e) à cuire la couche mince avec motif pour former une pluralité de conducteurs à connecter aux électrodes et (f) à former une couche mince conductrice afin de connecter les première et seconde électrodes.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>